\subsection{TimesFM}

TimesFM is originally trained on a large number of public and synthetic datasets and exhibits robust out-of-the-box zero-shot performance in comparison to the accuracy of various state-of-the-art forecasting models specific to individual datasets under consideration. At inference time, the model has enough flexibility to forecast with different input lengths, prediction lengths, and time granularities.
