$$
\text{MDA} = \frac{100}{P} \sum_{\ell=1}^{P} \mathbf{1} \left( \operatorname{sign}(\text{RV}_{t+\ell} - \text{RV}_{t+\ell-1}) = \operatorname{sign}(\widehat{\text{RV}}_{t+\ell} - \widehat{\text{RV}}_{t+\ell-1}) \right)
$$
