$$
\text{QLIKE} = \frac{1}{P} \sum_{\ell=1}^{P} \left[ \frac{\text{RV}_{t+\ell}}{\widehat{\text{RV}}_{t+\ell}} - \log\left( \frac{\text{RV}_{t+\ell}}{\widehat{\text{RV}}_{t+\ell}} \right) - 1 \right]
$$
