To address $J_{13},$ decompose
\begin{align*}
J_{13} & :=\frac{2\Delta\pi^{'}Z^{'}ZZ^{'}\varepsilon}{\left\Vert \varepsilon\right\Vert ^{2}\sqrt{2\text{tr}\left(\Sigma^{2}\right)}}+\frac{2\Delta v^{'}ZZ^{'}\varepsilon}{\left\Vert \varepsilon\right\Vert ^{2}\sqrt{2\text{tr}\left(\Sigma^{2}\right)}}\\
