Let \[C\sse W\sse M\setminus \partial M\] be subsets such that
$C$ is compact and $W$ is open.
If $q\co W\longrightarrow M$ is a smooth embedding,
then there exists a compact set $K$ with
\[C\subseteq\inte K\subseteq K\subseteq \inte (M)\] 
