\title{Learning to Coordinate Bidders in Non-Truthful Auctions}


\author{
Hu Fu\thanks{Shanghai University of Finance and Economics, School of Computing and Artificial Intelligence; Key Laboratory of Interdisciplinary Research of Computation and Economics.  \texttt{fuhu@mail.shufe.edu.cn}.}
